==Battleground==
*2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hajime Saito (Enemy)|Hajime Saito]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.
**6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring Ramen cat (or his previous evolutions) and, if you have him, Colossal Benkai (or his previous evolution.) Stilts/Totem/Acrobat helps for the Slepnir. Bring cats that outrange Sleipnir, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], his [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] counterpart or [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]]. Rushers like Awakened Bahamut Cat can also work well, but they are not reliable as they typically have less range than Sleipnir, and could just bounce off him and get stunlocked.

